The source is "(1+(4+5+2)-3)+(6+8)".
Keep a shared stack as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared total as 0.
Keep a shared polarity as 0.
Set polarity to 1.
Keep a shared number as 0.
Keep a shared depth as 0.
To close.
Set total to total plus polarity times number.
Set number to 0.
The savedpolarity is item (depth minus 1) of stack.
remove the last item from stack.
Set depth to depth minus 1.
The savedtotal is item (depth minus 1) of stack.
remove the last item from stack.
Set depth to depth minus 1.
Set total to savedtotal plus savedpolarity times total.
Set polarity to 1.

The last is the last position of source.
For every spot from 0 to last.
The symbol is character spot of source.
If symbol is between "0" and "9", The digit is the digit value of symbol, set number to number times 10 plus digit.
If symbol is "+", set total to total plus polarity times number, set number to 0, set polarity to 1.
If symbol is "-", set total to total plus polarity times number, set number to 0, set polarity to 0 minus 1.
If symbol is "(", Place total into stack, Place polarity into stack, add 2 to depth, set total to 0, set polarity to 1.
If symbol is ")", close.

Set total to total plus polarity times number.
Show total.
